  + internal/api/ai_chatbot_handler.go                   (NEW, ~210 lines)
      - type AIChatbotHandler { db, log, registry (provider.Registry),
        strategy *chatbotllm.Strategy, tools tools.Registry, audit AuditWriter }
      - ServeHTTP:
          1. Decode JSON {message, session_id} (typed DTO)
          2. Persist user message to chat_messages
          3. Load up-to-16-message history (drop last user turn)
          4. Set provider.WithSubject(ctx, sub) + WithFeatureID(ctx, fid)
          5. Open stream.Writer (SSE headers + flush ticker)
          6. dispatch.Dispatcher with denyAllConfirm + maxIters=6
          7. recordingStreamWriter tee captures deltas for assistant persistence
          8. On finish: persist assistant message + close SSE
      - recordingStreamWriter implements dispatch.StreamWriter AND
        the optional dispatch.LimitErrorEmitter (forwards stream.LimitDecisionPayload).
      - denyAllConfirm: returns false for any tool requiring confirmation
        (chatbot has zero mutating tools — defence-in-depth).

